  "2026-10-20T04:55:11.601Z","harness:codex","Reproduced GH-1511 independently on the current build: a two-row producer cursor walk repeats pm-active and loses pm-next. The same dedicated integration suite independently reproduces missing legacy blocker identity, 29/200 rounding to14, and deps cursor advice naming unsupported --after. The first setup-only failures were corrected and are not regression proof. Final pre-fix receipt: four intended behavioral failures on real disposable trackers; no repository tracker is used by tests. Implementation confines active blocked rows to their producer page while retaining lifecycle-blocked companion detail."
