  "2026-10-20T05:25:21.171Z","harness:codex","Complete local coverage attempt ended with exactly one assertion failure: existing tests/unit/sdk/governance-read-performance.spec.ts measured health10177.906399ms against its unchanged10000ms ceiling. The full new context transport regression file passed. Vitest withheld coverage-summary.json after the failing run, and the exact coverage gate consequently failed; neither full-suite success nor100percent coverage is claimed. Preserve this immutable failed linked receipt. Isolated reproduction, complete static gates and final hosted exact-head coverage remain required; no timeout or performance assertion is relaxed."
  "2026-10-20T05:33:19.953Z","harness:codex","The complete local run has10823 passed cases, one governance-read performance failure and three explicit skips across834files; elapsed1147seconds. All four new regressions and the real Node/Bun composed continuation case pass. The four-way published writer/reader compatibility matrix also passes for2026.10.18 and2026.10.19, including SDK exact unknown fields restore native merge and history. Fresh installed npm and Bun2026.10.20 agent sessions pass13steps each. A focused instrumented diagnostic is queued after static validation to recheck the existing performance assertion without concurrent local acceptance work and expose changed-module coverage; its partial global denominator will remain a diagnostic, not a full-suite pass."
